<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Sun Micro estimate raised.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Sun Micro estimate raised.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- SoundView Financial said it raised its fiscal 1997 earnings estimate on Sun Microsystems Inc to $3.55 a share from $3.46.</p>
<p>-- The stock rose 1/8 to 63-1/8.</p>
</text>
